{"version":1,"key":"card:156","content":{"id":156,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"除了基本的选择器，CSS 还提供了一些高级的选择器，提供更多的灵活性。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"de6125ed-4dc0-4daf-ab86-d2d6a70d7b0d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"后代选择器","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9b0715f3-1710-49ca-9b48-c947c2dca3c8","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"看一个🌰：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e4123eab-beac-4c7f-b7ef-efb479693799","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<div>\n  <p>简单的 p 标签</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li>\n    <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li>\n    <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>","collabId":"264c475a-34ab-44cc-b8db-808037b88457","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e9f13976-c32f-4aa1-8016-c54e83cf837a","language":"html","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"723443bc-d8f3-4016-aaaf-d12630bc41d3"},{"children":[{"text":"现在我们希望只为 ul 里面所有的 p 标签添加样式，在 ul 外面的 p 不添加样式。一个想法是为 ul 里面的 p 添加一个类名，然后通过类名选择器添加样式，现在我们可以通过后代选择器轻松的做到这一点","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e3d352cd-4711-449f-81f0-5a7f20112b81","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"ul p {\n  color: red;\n}","collabId":"e5c76753-7ba6-46d6-ac27-23f58b4f6dce","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"9beb5fc8-308e-4f59-a9d4-e58aa1766cd7","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"880ea3ab-e9df-4cd8-9022-3a13fe381211"},{"children":[{"text":"上面的选择器 ul p 表示的就是选择 ul 标签下的所有的 p 标签，在两个选择器直接使用空格隔开，🌰","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0eb17d1e-95a7-43a8-a0c1-72d2606f47b5","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"/* 选择.container 下的所有 p 标签 */\n.container p {\n}\n\n/* 选择 #main 下的 .head */\n#main .head {\n}","collabId":"8de045b1-c603-4514-96e7-399baea4e540","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"45495c09-73c0-4cf6-99ab-912a63f21116","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"051ddd58-0f19-4d53-9492-2dbdfc1121c4"},{"children":[{"text":"子选择器","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"afbf6f19-136a-4bcf-b9cc-8efc3fd1fe50","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"后代选择器可以选择所有的后代，子选择器只能选择直属后代，什么叫直属后代，看这个结构","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e36b1e4c-61f0-428e-aa0c-4924a050bd60","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<ul>\n  <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li>\n  <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li>\n  <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li>\n</ul>","collabId":"fe6df881-d8bf-41d8-87bb-3557c1bc73b2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"a137010d-c3a3-4fa7-bf52-779d29be05a9","language":"html","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"e46ad210-b676-4663-8182-fb9161ad859e"},{"children":[{"text":"其中 li 是 ul 的直属后代，p 是 li 的直属后代，但是 p 不是 ul 的直属后代，因为中间隔着一个 li。选择器的语法就是 li > p，中间使用 > 连接两个选择器。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"39e67090-c232-4255-b3ea-3cc7657c2b24","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"同辈选择器","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0eb4d200-72cc-4f84-80ad-2cdb915219f4","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"上面的后代选择器与子选择器都是通过父标签定位子标签，那么同辈选择器就提供了通过同辈定位同辈的功能。假设有如下的 HTML 结构","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1f651454-471d-40fc-88cb-b77bca60ae28","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<div>\n  <h2>标题</h2>\n  <p>床前明月光</p>\n  <p>疑是地上霜</p>\n  <p>举头望明月</p>\n  <p>低头思故乡</p>\n</div>","collabId":"4ce9bba3-90ef-454d-8faa-7c5614f2010b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b6a49140-9774-458c-ad00-f2772235f633","language":"html","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"65b59147-a069-4d62-bd4d-6d556946664e"},{"children":[{"text":"同辈选择器也分为两种，第一种称为相邻同辈选择器，使用 + 将两个选择器连接起来","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c3b76020-33b1-48e9-a40a-b1f1610f0de4","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"h2 + p {\n  color: red;\n}","collabId":"88dabc73-28e3-4aa1-b95a-c9429f383cd0","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"7c409073-4402-4b00-9ebe-689d8a8641f6","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"2626555a-06ef-4050-a424-216502b93920"},{"children":[{"text":"h2 + p 只会选择与 h2 相邻的后面的那个 p 标签。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"acbce475-65a5-4fca-8f61-906bc4f0428f","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"另一个同辈选择叫做一般同辈选择器，使用 ~ 将两个选择器连接起来，例如 h2 ~ p 表示选择 h2 后面所有的 p 标签、","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3661deab-f34b-4342-a580-2d09b6acaceb","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"h2 ~ p {\n  color: red;\n}","collabId":"ff0f8010-5f67-4b73-9106-fe1f2ceae3df","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"98e83f98-2f48-4e23-a18e-15e2f7b2624e","language":"CSS","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"433c8dff-fdde-487d-82a6-c34d43af7eb5"},{"children":[{"text":"交集选择器","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1bc80d1c-a52c-4f7d-8bda-55ac1711d720","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"两个选择器之间没有任何的分隔即可形成交集选择器，只有同时满足这两个选择器的条件的标签才会被选中。例如我们希望选择包含类名为 container 的 div 标签，这里我们有两个条件：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b3d35171-6ace-434d-adeb-7eecf70f41be","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"包含类名 .container","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ee5f7af6-1b88-457f-95d6-01e7dde3c1cd","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"15a038be-616f-416e-81b4-ecd70f451474","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"必须是 div 标签","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"efe83f93-bfad-41d2-8cca-cbc2941e3f51","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"44d87265-20f2-4c3c-aa0c-24f30abe1e2a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"b6ecbf5e-cb53-45c7-bab1-c6ca59062efe","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"这时我们就可以使用交集选择器","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e7c52e45-a877-4098-b592-f198d5c4b907","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"/* 既包含 container 类名，又必须是 div 标签 */\ndiv.container {\n}","collabId":"8bc379af-0a4a-4f97-993c-5c072cbfd21f","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0263803d-ff8a-46fd-ae49-9116917a764f","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"bb38361f-e997-48c8-a793-b8b1f1497769"},{"children":[{"text":"并集选择器","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"28d9e8dd-a102-45ca-b908-55c64c501878","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"多个选择器通过 , 分隔形成并集选择器，任何标签满足并集选择器中的任意一个选择器，就会被该并集选择器选中","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"82dd12c9-5f2b-487f-bad7-a2400ce8c155","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"h1,\nh2,\nh3,\nh4,\nh5,\nh6 {\n  /* 为所有的标题应用样式 */\n}","collabId":"6348d091-8ed5-4df4-9efd-b4594c44df36","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"23a0e05a-2bb4-4cbb-8e42-39cd1cadd520","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"be2b3b11-f4b6-4349-a10c-285cb3f36db1"}],"tags":["CSS/选择器"],"createTime":1690213157024,"updateTime":1793532518494,"linkedCards":[{"id":155,"target":{"key":"card:155","type":"card","id":155},"summary":"通过 CSS 我们可以为标签添加样式，那么为哪一个标签添加样式，怎么给特定的标签添加样式，这就需要用到 CSS 选择器。 标签选择器 直接通过标签来为标签添加样式 <p>酒一杯一杯的干</p> p { color: brown; } 类选择...","tags":["CSS/选择器"]},{"id":207,"target":{"key":"card:207","type":"card","id":207},"summary":"document 包含一系列查找元素的方法，包括： getElementById getElementByTagName getElementByClassName getElementByName querySelector queryS...","tags":["DOM"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532518494}}